#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kmplot;"
msgstr "Upotreba &kmplot;"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmplot; deals with several different types of functions, which can be "
"written in function form or as an equation:"
msgstr ""
"&kmplot; radi sa nekoliko različitih tipova funkcija, koje mogu biti "
"zapisane u formi funkcije ili kao jednačina:"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cartesian plots can either be written as &eg; <quote>y = x^2</quote>, where "
"x has to be used as the variable; or as &eg; <quote>f(a) = a^2</quote>, "
"where the name of the variable is arbitrary."
msgstr ""
"Crteži u Dekartovom koordinatnom sistemu mogu biti zapisani kao &eg; "
"<quote>y = x^2</quote>,  gdje se x mora koristiti kao varijabla; ili kao "
"&eg; <quote>f(a) = a^2</quote>, gdje je ime varijable proizvoljno."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Parametric plots are similar to Cartesian plots. The x and y coordinates can "
"be entered as equations in t, &eg; <quote>x = sin(t)</quote>, <quote>y = cos"
"(t)</quote>, or as functions, &eg; <quote>f_x(s) = sin(s)</quote>, <quote>f_y"
"(s) = cos(s)</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Parametarski crteži su slični Dekartovim. Koordinate x i y se mogu unijeti "
"kao jednačine, &eg; <quote>x = sin(t)</quote>, <quote>y = cos(t)</quote>, "
"ili kao funkcije , &eg; <quote>f_x(s) = sin(s)</quote>, <quote>f_y(s) = cos"
"(s)</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Polar plots are also similar to Cartesian plots. They can be either be "
"entered as an equation in &thgr;, &eg; <quote>r = &thgr;</quote>, or as a "
"function, &eg; <quote>f(x) = x</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Crteži polarnih funkcija su također slični Dekartovim. Mogu se unijeti ili "
"kao jednačina u &thgr;, &eg; <quote>r = &thgr;</quote>, ili kao funkcija, "
"&eg; <quote>f(x) = x</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For implicit plots, the name of the function is entered separately from the "
"expression relating the x and y coordinates. If the x and y variables are "
"specified via the function name (by entering &eg;<quote>f(a,b)</quote> as "
"the function name), then these variables will be used. Otherwise, the "
"letters x and y will be used for the variables."
msgstr ""
"Za implicitne funkcije, ime funkcije se unosi odvojeno od izraza koji se "
"odnosi na x i y koordinate. Ako su x i y varijable specificirane pomoću "
"imena funkcije (unoseći &eg;<quote>f(a,b)</quote> as the function name),  "
"onda će se ove varijable koristiti. U suprotnom, oznake x i y će se "
"koristiti kao varijable."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Explicit differential plots are differential equations whereby the highest "
"derivative is given in terms of the lower derivatives. Differentiation is "
"denoted by a prime ('). In function form, the equation will look like "
"<quote>f''(x) = f' &minus; f</quote>. In equation form, it will look like "
"<quote>y'' = y' &minus; y</quote>. Note that in both cases, the <quote>(x)</"
"quote> part is not added to the lower order differential terms (so you would "
"enter <quote>f'(x) = &minus;f</quote> and not <quote>f'(x) = &minus;f(x)</"
"quote>)."
msgstr ""
"Eksplicitni diferencijalni crteži su diferencijalne jednačine gdje je izvod "
"višeg stepena zadan pomoću izvoda nižeg stepena. Diferencijacija je "
"obilježena sa prim('). U obliku funkcije, izraz će izgledati kao "
"<quote>f''(x) = f' &minus; f</quote>. U formi jednačine, izgledaće kao "
"<quote>y'' = y' &minus; y</quote>.  Primijetite da u oba slučaja <quote>y'' "
"= y' &minus; y</quote>.  dio nije dodan diferencijalnim izrazima nižeg reda "
"(da biste unijeli  <quote>f'(x) = &minus;f</quote> and not <quote>f'(x) = "
"&minus;f(x)</quote>)."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All the equation entry boxes come with a button on the right. Clicking this "
"invokes the advanced <guilabel>Equation Editor</guilabel> dialog, which "
"provides:"
msgstr ""
"Sva područja predviđena za unos jednačina imaju dugme desno od sebe. Klikom "
"na to dugme pokreće se napredni <guilabel>Equation Editor</guilabel> "
"dijalog, koji pruža:"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A variety of mathematical symbols that can be used in equations, but aren't "
"found on normal keyboards."
msgstr ""
"Raznovrsne matematičke simbole koji se mogu koristiti u jednačinama, ali se "
"ne nalaze na standardnim tastaturama."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "The list of user constants and a button for editing them."
msgstr ""
"Listu svih konstanti napravljenih od strane korisnika i dugme koje omogućava "
"njihovu konfiguraciju."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The list of predefined functions. Note that if you have text already "
"selected, it will be used as the function argument when a function is "
"inserted. For example, if <quote>1 + x</quote> is selected in the equation "
"<quote>y = 1 + x</quote>, and the sine function is chosen, then the equation "
"will become <quote> y = sin(1+x)</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Listu svih unaprijed definisanih funkcija. Imajte na umu da ukoliko ste već "
"selektirali tekst, da će se on koristiti kao argument funkcije kad funkcija "
"bude umetnuta. Npr., ako je <quote>1 + x</quote> selektirano u jednačini "
"<quote>y = 1 + x</quote>, i ako je izabrana funkcija sinus, onda će "
"jednačina postati <quote> y = sin(1+x)</quote>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: using.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here is a screenshot of the &kmplot; welcome window"
msgstr "Evo jednog snimka ekrana početnog prozora &kmplot;"

#. Tag: phrase
#: using.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana"

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Function Types"
msgstr "Tipovi funkcija"

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cartesian Functions"
msgstr "Dekartove funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter an explicit function (&ie;, a function in the form y=f(x)) into "
"&kmplot;, just enter it in the following form: "
"<screen><userinput><replaceable>f</replaceable>(<replaceable>x</"
"replaceable>) = <replaceable>expression</replaceable></userinput></screen> "
"where:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste unijeli eksplicitnu funkciju (&ie;, funkciju u obliku y=f(x)) u "
"&kmplot;, samo je unesite u sljedećem obliku: "
"<screen><userinput><replaceable>f</replaceable>(<replaceable>x</"
"replaceable>) = <replaceable>expression</replaceable></userinput></screen> "
"gdje je:"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<replaceable>f</replaceable> is the name of the function, and can be any "
"string of letters and numbers."
msgstr ""
"<replaceable>f</replaceable> ime funkcije, i može biti bilo koji niz slova i "
"brojeva."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<replaceable>x</replaceable> is the horizontal coordinate, to be used in the "
"expression following the equals sign. It is a dummy variable, so you can use "
"any variable name you like to achieve the same effect."
msgstr ""
"<replaceable>x</replaceable> horizontalna koordinata, koja će se koristiti u "
"izrazu koji slijedi iza znaka jednakosti. Možete koristiti bilo koje ime "
"varijable, efekat se neće promijeniti."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<replaceable>expression</replaceable> is the expression to be plotted, given "
"in the appropriate syntax for &kmplot;. See <xref linkend=\"math-syntax\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<replaceable>expression</replaceable> je izraz koji će biti skiciran, "
"ukoliko je zadan u odgovarajućoj formi za &kmplot;. Pogledajte <xref linkend="
"\"math-syntax\"/>."

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Parametric Functions"
msgstr "Parametarske funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Parametric functions are those in which the x and y coordinates are defined "
"by separate functions of another variable, often called t. To enter a "
"parametric function in &kmplot;, follow the procedure as for a Cartesian "
"function for each of the x and y functions. As with Cartesian functions, you "
"may use any variable name you wish for the parameter."
msgstr ""
"Parametarske funkcije su one kod kojih su x i y koordinata definisane pomoću "
"odvojene funkcije neke druge varijable, često obilježavanom sa t. Da biste "
"unijeli parametarsku funkciju u  &kmplot;, pratite poceduru Dekartove "
"funkcije za svaku od x i y funkcija. Kao i sa Dekartovim funkcijama, možete "
"koristiti bilo koje ime varijable kao parametar."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As an example, suppose you want to draw a circle, which has parametric "
"equations x = sin(t), y = cos(t). After creating a parametric plot, enter "
"the appropriate equations in the x and y boxes, &ie;, <userinput>f_x(t)=sin"
"(t)</userinput> and <userinput>f_y(t)=cos(t)</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Kao primjer, pretpostavimo da želite nacrtati krug, koji ima parametarsku "
"jednačinu x = sin(t), y = cos(t). Nakon kreiranja parametarskog crteža, "
"unesite odgovarajuće jednačine za x i y, &ie;, <userinput>f_x(t)=sin(t)</"
"userinput> i <userinput>f_y(t)=cos(t)</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:86 using.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can set some further options for the plot in the function editor:"
msgstr "Možete postaviti još neke opcije za crtež u funkcijskom uredniku:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: using.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Min</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Min</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: using.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Max</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Max</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These options control the range of the parameter t for which the function is "
"plotted."
msgstr ""
"Ove opcije kontrolišu opseg parametra t za koji će funkcija biti nacrtana."

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Functions in Polar Coordinates"
msgstr "Funkcije zadane polarnim koordinatama"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Polar coordinates represent a point by its distance from the origin (usually "
"called r), and the angle a line from the origin to the point makes with the "
"horizontal axis (usually represented by &thgr; the Greek letter theta). To "
"enter functions in polar coordinates, click the <guilabel>Create</guilabel> "
"button and select <guilabel>Polar Plot</guilabel> from the list. In the "
"definition box, complete the function definition, including the name of the "
"theta variable you want to use, &eg;, to draw the Archimedes' spiral r = "
"&thgr;, enter: <screen><userinput>r(&thgr;) = &thgr;</userinput></screen> "
"Note that you can use any name for the theta variable, so <quote>r(t) = t</"
"quote> or <quote>f(x) = x</quote> will produce exactly the same output."
msgstr ""
"Polarne koordinate predstavljaju tačku pomoću njene udaljenosti od "
"koordinatnog početka(koja se uobičajeno obilježava sa r) i sa uglom koji "
"linija koja spaja koordinatni početak i tu tačku zaklapa sa horizontalnom "
"osom(koji se uobičajeno obilježava sa &thgr; grčkim slovom teta). Da biste "
"unijeli funkciju u polarnim koordinatama, kliknite na <guilabel>Create</"
"guilabel> dugme i odaberite <guilabel>Polar Plot</guilabel> iz liste. Na "
"mjestu predviđenom za to, dopunite definiciju funkcije, uključujući i ime "
"teta varijable koje želite koristiti, &eg;, za crtanje Arhimedove spirale r "
"= &thgr;, unesite: <screen><userinput>r(&thgr;) = &thgr;</userinput></"
"screen> Primijetite da možete koristiti bilo koje ime za teta varijablu, "
"tako da će <quote>r(t) = t</quote> or <quote>f(x) = x</quote> proizvesti "
"tačno isti rezultat."

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Implicit Functions"
msgstr "Implicitne funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An implicit expression relates the x and y coordinates as an equality. To "
"create a circle, for example, click the <guilabel>Create</guilabel> button "
"and select <guilabel>Implicit Plot</guilabel> from the list. Then, enter "
"into the equation box (below the function name box) the following:"
msgstr ""
"Implicitni izraz povezuje x i y u obliku jednakosti. Npr., da biste "
"napravili krug, kliknite  <guilabel>Create</guilabel> dugme i odaberite "
"<guilabel>Implicit Plot</guilabel> iz liste. Onda, u prostor za jednačinu"
"(ispod prostora za ime funkcije) unesite sljedeće:"

#. Tag: screen
#: using.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>x^2 + y^2 = 25</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>x^2 + y^2 = 25</userinput>"

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Differential Functions"
msgstr "Diferencijalne funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmplot; can plot explicit differential equations. These are equations of "
"the form y<superscript>(n)</superscript> = F(x,y',y'',...,y<superscript>"
"(n&minus;1)</superscript>), where y<superscript>k</superscript> is the "
"k<superscript>th</superscript> derivative of y(x). &kmplot; can only "
"interpret the derivative order as the number of primes following the "
"function name. To draw a sinusoidal curve, for example, you would use the "
"differential equation <userinput>y'' = &minus; y</userinput> or "
"<userinput>f''(x) = −f</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"&kmplot; može skicirati eksplicitne diferencijalne jednačine. Ovo su "
"jednačine oblika  y<superscript>(n)</superscript> = F(x,y',y'',...,"
"y<superscript>(n&minus;1)</superscript>), gdje je y<superscript>k</"
"superscript> k<superscript>th</superscript> izvod od y(x). &kmplot; može "
"prepoznati red izvoda samo kao broj primova koji se nalaze iza imena "
"funkcije. Npr., da biste nacrtali sinusoidalnu krivu, koristili biste "
"diferencijalnu jednačinu <userinput>y'' = &minus; y</userinput> ili "
"<userinput>f''(x) = −f</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, a differential equation on its own isn't enough to determine a "
"plot. Each curve in the diagram is generated by a combination of the "
"differential equation and the initial conditions. You can edit the initial "
"conditions by clicking on the <guilabel>Initial Conditions</guilabel> tab "
"when a differential equation is selected. The number of columns provided for "
"editing the initial conditions is dependent on the order of the differential "
"equation."
msgstr ""
"Ipak, samo diferencijalna jednačina nije dovoljna da bi se odredila skica. "
"Svaka kriva dijagrama je generisana kombinacijom diferencijalnih jednačina i "
"njenih početnih uslova. Početne uslove možete urediti pomoću klika na  "
"<guilabel>Početni uslovi</guilabel> karticu kada je diferencijalna jednačina "
"odabrana. Broj kolona obezbijeđenih za uređivanje početnih uslova ovisi o "
"redu diferencijalne jednačine."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: using.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Korak"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The step value in the precision box is used in numerically solving the "
"differential equation (using the Runge Kutta method). Its value is the "
"maximum step size used; a smaller step size may be used if part of the "
"differential plot is zoomed in close enough."
msgstr ""
"Vrijednost koraka koja se nalazi u prostoru obilježenom za preciznost se "
"koristi da bi se numerčki riješila diferencijalna jednačina(upotrebom Runge "
"Kutta metode). Ta vrijednost je maksimalna vrijednost koraka koja se "
"koristi; manji korak bi se mogao koristiti ukoliko bi se dio crteza "
"diferencijalne jednačine dovoljno zumirao."

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Combining Functions"
msgstr "Kombinovane funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Functions can be combined to produce new ones. Simply enter the functions "
"after the equals sign in an expression as if the functions were variables. "
"For example, if you have defined functions f(x) and g(x), you can plot the "
"sum of f and g with:"
msgstr ""
"Funkcije se mogu kombinovati da bi se dobile nove funkcije. Jednostavno "
"unesite funkcije nakon znaka jednakosti u izrazu  kao da su funkcije "
"varijable. Npr. ukoliko ste definisali funkcije f(x) i g(x), možete "
"skicirati sumu tih funkcija sa:"

#. Tag: screen
#: using.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>sum(x) = f(x) + g(x)</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sum(x) = f(x) + g(x)</userinput>"

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing the appearance of functions"
msgstr "Promjena izgleda funkcija"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the appearance of a function's graph on the main plot window, "
"select the function in the <guilabel>Functions</guilabel> sidebar. You can "
"change the plot's line width, color and many other aspects by clicking on "
"the <guibutton>Color</guibutton> or <guibutton>Advanced...</guibutton> "
"button at the bottom of the section <guilabel>Appearance</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste promijenili izgled grafa funkcije u glavnom prozoru za skiciranje, "
"odaberite funkciju u <guilabel>Funkcije</guilabel> sa strane. Možete "
"promijeniti debljinu linija skice, boju i mnoge druge aspekte pomoću klika "
"na <guibutton>Boja</guibutton> ili na <guibutton>Napredno...</guibutton> "
"dugme na dnu sekcije  <guilabel>Appearance</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are editing a Cartesian function, the function editor will have three "
"tabs. In the first one you specify the equation of the function. The "
"<guilabel>Derivatives</guilabel> tab lets you draw the first and second "
"derivative to the function. With the <guilabel>Integral</guilabel> tab you "
"can draw the integral of the function."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko uređujete Dekartovu funkciju, urednik funkcije će ima ti tri tab-a. "
"U prvom možete specificirati jednačinu funkcije. Tab <guilabel>Derivatives</"
"guilabel> vam omogućava da nacrtate prvi i drugi izvod funkcije. U tab-u "
"<guilabel>Integral</guilabel>  možete nacrtati integral funkcije."

#. Tag: title
#: using.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Popup menu"
msgstr "Iskočni meni"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: using.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Graph right-click popup menu</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Graf - desni klik na iskočni meni</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: using.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Graph right-click popup menu</phrase>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Graf - lijevii klik na iskočni meni</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When right-clicking on a plot function or a single-point parametric plot "
"function a popup menu will appear. In the menu there are three items "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"Prilikom desnog klika na skiciranu funkciju ili na samo jednu tačku "
"skicirane parametarske funkcije, popup meni će se pojaviti. Na meniju se "
"nalaze tri stavke:"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Izmijeni"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Selects the function in the <guilabel>Functions</guilabel> sidebar for "
"editing."
msgstr ""
"Izabira funkciju u <guilabel>Funckcije</guilabel> bočnoj traci za uređivanje."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Sakrij"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hides the selected graph. Other plots of the graph's function will still be "
"shown."
msgstr ""
"Sakriva selektirani graf. Ostale skice grafa funkcije će i dalje biti "
"prikazane."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Ukloni"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes the function. All its graphs will disappear."
msgstr "Uklanja funkciju. Svi njeni grafovi će nestati."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Animate Plot..."
msgstr "Animiranje crteža..."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "Displays the <guilabel>Parameter Animator</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr "Prikazuje <guilabel>Parameter Animator</guilabel> dijalog."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "Kalkulator"

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the <guilabel>Calculator</guilabel> dialog."
msgstr "Otvara <guilabel>Kalkulator</guilabel> dijalog."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on the plot type, there will also be up to four tools available:"
msgstr "U ovisnosti od vrste skice, pojaviće se do 4 alata:"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plot Area..."
msgstr "Područje crtanja...."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the minimum and maximum horizontal values for the graph in the new "
"dialog that appears. Calculates the integral and draws the area between the "
"graph and the horizontal axis in the selected range in the color of the "
"graph."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite minimalnu i maksimalnu horizontalnu vrijednost za graf koji će se "
"pojaviti u novom dijalogu. Računa integral i crta oblast između grafa i "
"horizontalne ose u odabranom intervalu u boji grafa."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find Minimum..."
msgstr "Nađi minimum..."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Find the minimum value of the graph in a specified range. The selected graph "
"will be highlighted in the dialog that appears. Enter the lower and upper "
"boundaries of the region in which you want to search for a minimum."
msgstr ""
"Pronalazi minimalnu vrijednost grafa u određenom intervalu. Selektirani graf "
"će biti istaknut u dijalogu koji se pojavi. Unesite donji i gornju granicu "
"oblasti u kojoj želite da tražite minimum."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note: You can also tell the plot to visually show the extreme points in the "
"<guilabel>Plot Appearance</guilabel> dialog, accessible in the "
"<guilabel>Functions</guilabel> sidebar by clicking on <guibutton>Advanced..."
"</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Također možete odabrati da se na skici prikažu ekstremne tačke u "
"<guilabel>Izgled crtanja</guilabel> dijalogu, do kojeg se može doći u "
"<guilabel>Funkcije</guilabel> sidebar-u pomoću klika na "
"<guibutton>Napredno...</guibutton>."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: using.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find Maximum..."
msgstr "Nađi maksimum..."

#. Tag: para
#: using.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the same as <guimenuitem>Find Minimum...</guimenuitem> above, but "
"finds the maximum value instead of the minimum value."
msgstr ""
"Funkcioniše na isti način kao <guimenuitem>Nađi minimum...</guimenuitem>, "
"ali pronalazi maksimalnu vrijednost umjesto minimalne."
